# Regenerant Catalunya GG24 - Project Overview

## Project Context
**Regenerant Catalunya** is a pioneering participatory funding round launching October 14-28, 2025 during Gitcoin Grants Round 24. It demonstrates how local knowledge integrates with global Web3 infrastructure for bioregional regeneration.

## Key Facts
- **Total Funding Pool:** €26,000 (€11k local + €15k from global matching)
- **Projects Funded:** 11 carefully curated regenerative projects across Catalonia
- **Local Partners:** Miceli Social (€6k), La Fundició/Keras Buti (€5k)
- **Global Partners:** Gitcoin, Celo Public Goods, Ethereum Foundation, Regen Coordination
- **Launch Date:** October 14, 2025 ✅ Completed
- **Current Phase:** Phase 4 - Program Execution (Nov 2025-Mar 2026)
- **TODAY:** December 2025 - Phase 1 reporting in progress

## Core Team (ReFi Barcelona)
- **Luiz Fernando Segala Gomes:** Strategy Lead (20h/week) - Finance, global partnerships, treasury
